## Project Structure Guide

- App is a React SPA using Tailwind, Radix UI, Zustand, and Supabase.
- Dashboard composition lives in [pages/Dashboard/index.jsx](mdc:src/pages/Dashboard/index.jsx).
- Reusable UI primitives are in [components/ui](mdc:src/components/ui/).
- Feature widgets/components live under [components/Dashboard](mdc:src/components/Dashboard/).
- Pomodoro core lives under [components/Pomodoro](mdc:src/components/Pomodoro/).
- Global styles and design tokens are in [styles/global.css](mdc:src/styles/global.css).
- Client state stores live under [store](mdc:src/store/).
- Supabase APIs live under [db/apis](mdc:src/db/apis/), using tables from [constants/db.js](mdc:src/constants/db.js) and helpers from [utils/db.js](mdc:src/utils/db.js).
- Data transformers (snake_case ↔ camelCase) live under [utils/transformers](mdc:src/utils/transformers/), with mappings like [tasks.js](mdc:src/utils/transformers/tasks.js) and utilities in [common.js](mdc:src/utils/transformers/common.js).
- Date utilities live in [utils/date.js](mdc:src/utils/date.js).

### Notable Dashboard Pieces

- Header: [components/Dashboard/DashboardHeader/index.jsx](mdc:src/components/Dashboard/DashboardHeader/index.jsx)
- Total Hours: [components/Dashboard/TotalHoursWidget/index.jsx](mdc:src/components/Dashboard/TotalHoursWidget/index.jsx)
- Journals: [components/Dashboard/JournalsWidget/index.jsx](mdc:src/components/Dashboard/JournalsWidget/index.jsx)
- Task List: [components/Dashboard/TaskListWidget/index.jsx](mdc:src/components/Dashboard/TaskListWidget/index.jsx)
